<h1 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-large-font-size" id="concept" style="padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--80);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--80);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)">What are Workpods<span style="color: orange">?</span></h1>

<p class="has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size" style="padding-right:10vw;padding-left:10vw;margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);max-width:800px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto"><strong>Workpods</strong> are smart, modular coworking spaces – private pods where you can focus and work. We're building a <strong>network of workpods</strong> across cities: flexible coworking spaces that redefine commercial real estate.</p>

<div class="wp-block-columns column-layout is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-flex wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex" style="padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);gap:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)">
