<p class="has-text-align-center" style="margin-bottom:0">Rent pods <strong>on-demand</strong> – by the hour or day. No leases, no commitments. Book when you need it, pay for what you use.</p>
</div>

<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="border-radius:10px;box-shadow:var(--wp--preset--shadow--natural);background:#fff;padding:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)">
