<p class="has-text-align-center" style="margin-bottom:0">We're building <strong>commercial real estate</strong> – a growing network of workpod locations that transform how people work.</p>
</div>
</div>

<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size" style="margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)">Who can rent workpods<span style="color: orange">?</span></h2>

<div class="wp-block-columns column-layout is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-flex wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex" style="padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)">
